    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Midnight Wind is a sarcastic single-player pixel art RPG following the story of four hosts of the souls of a dead star. The story loosely takes place in Indonesia, where players will embark on a bare-bones journey to protect themselves and their people. The four hosts are named Altara, Osmos, Nabur, and Torren Voldusaya, the bratty children of a royal family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently includes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200 different enemies to encounter </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 260 different weapons and armors to equip </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 12 characters to play as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Approximately 20 hours of gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 200+ different items to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- &quot;Interesting&quot; dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Current version 1.5 Beta. We're back!</p>",
